 *     use a preset.
 *
 *     You have the following targets available:
 *         SMAA_HLSL_3
 *         SMAA_HLSL_4
 *         SMAA_HLSL_4_1
 *         SMAA_GLSL_3 *
 *         SMAA_GLSL_4 *
 *
